        "filing_date": "2026-04-08",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Within our service clusters, we have developed specific areas of expertise and proprietary platforms that are combined with established R&D capabilities designed to offer holistic drug discovery and development solutions.",
